  "about" : "Frames the iOS port emits: Carol's identity from fixed keys, her signed profile and room post, a v1 DM she seals to Bob from keyed-v1.json, their safety number, and a group she makes with Alice and Bob: a v1 group message, her rename and her leave. With the ratchet (A10): her ratchet profile, and what her mesh engine sends Bob and Alice with the ratchet on: a v3 DM that opens a session, inline acks, a sealed receipt, profile, reaction and retraction, seeds for a group of the three, a group-form message and a group-form reaction; ratchet says how to open them. Carol's link proofs as dialer and responder, under link, with every HELLO at caps 40009 (link-hello-proof), and her sealed links as dialer and responder, under link.seal, with every HELLO at caps 140009 (link-seal). Written by knit-ios with KNIT_WRITE_VECTORS=1; IosEmittedVectorTest checks it. See vectors/README.md.",
